{"id":580537003,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1ODA1MzcwMDM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdextension","name":"topic:gdextension","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","number":23,"title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2978,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-05-22T16:25:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T16:23:23Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-01-26T18:09:14Z"},"comments":6,"created_at":"2025-11-28T14:48:27Z","updated_at":"2025-12-03T14:46:47Z","closed_at":"2025-12-03T02:43:24Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113282","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113282","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113282.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113282.patch","merged_at":"2025-12-03T02:43:24Z"},"body":"Now that https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/86079 is merged, we've got to mark some more things as required!\r\n\r\nSince we don't have too much time before the feature freeze, the goal of this PR is to try and mark the things that would provide the highest value to developers (and we'll get everything else later for Godot 4.7).\r\n\r\nWhich things are high value is guided by some crowd-sourced feedback that @Bromeon got from the Godot Rust community (see [spreadsheet](https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/e/2PACX-1vRJU5bsFRjzEJeL-HmHqJP0C9Oj0Sj-A5f1mcY2vxusAcfRBO-OaVYxAoRJ9q5cx8uEUJj9y1vh8ZP_/pubhtml)) and some notes from @migueldeicaza with regard to SwiftGodot.\r\n\r\nI've focused on these areas:\r\n\r\n- The classes high-up in the hierarchy (like `Node`, `Control`, `CanvasItem`, etc)\r\n- Physics and Input (because they're used in most games)\r\n- Tween (because it was called out by Rust developers)\r\n\r\nTotal number of things marked as required: **139** ([tracking spreadsheet](https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1DMB7hff-ybhdTkdFCPWDfuMUG7MQXCFtj2BW1hKRFwM/edit?usp=sharing))\r\n\r\n~~**Marking this as DRAFT for now, because I'd still like to mark more stuff, but I'll take it out of DRAFT in 1-2 days.**~~\r\n\r\nThis is also a great opportunity to test `RequiredParam<T>` and `RequiredResult<T>` in more contexts, and see if we missed anything in their design.\r\n\r\nIt's already turn up a couple of things:\r\n\r\n- Some changes are required for them to work in `GDVIRTUAL*()`. One of the changes is something I've wanted to do for a long time (use `PtrToArg<T>::encode()` to encode the arguments - doing this with a cast has bothered me for so long)\r\n- ~~There is an \"ambiguous overload for 'operator='\" error for `Ref<T> v = RequiredResult<T>()` which I'm not sure how to fix - advice would be appreciated!~~ I have a solution for this now. I've removed the `operator Variant()` from `RequiredResult<T>` and added an internal helper method for the handful of situations when we need to generically convert from `RequiredResult<T>` to `Variant`","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113282/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":3},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113282/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}